Combined the null/bounds checks into a single unlikely-predicted branch so the common valid path is a straight-line load-and-return with better code layout.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumSubFields(void) const
{
    if (__builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0))
        return 0;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].numSubFields;
}
```